          "Legion Officer Wargear (may take up to 1): Bolt pistol, Chainsword, Bolter (+5 pts), Volkite serpenta (+5 pts), Plasma pistol (+5 pts), Hand flamer (+5 pts), Disintegrator pistol (+5 pts), Chainaxe, Power sword (+10 pts), Power axe (+10 pts), Power maul (+10 pts), Power lance (+10 pts), Power fist (+15 pts), Lightning claw (+10 pts), Thunder hammer (+15 pts), Combat shield, Boarding shield (+5 pts), Charnabal sabre (+5 pts), Bolt pistol",
