        "name": "Legion standard",
        "description": "When resolving a Combat in the Resolution Sub-Phase of the Assault Phase, score 2 Combat Resolution Points for each Unit that Combat that has any Models that have a Legion standard. In addition, a Model with a Legion Standard counts as an additional 6 Models for the purposes of Outside Support in a Challenge."
