          "Mechanicum Melee Weapons (may take up to 1): Thunder hammer (+15 pts), Chainaxe, Heavy chainsword (+5 pts), Heavy chainaxe (+5 pts), Chainsword, Chainfist (+10 pts), Power fist (+15 pts), Power sword (+10 pts), Power axe (+10 pts), Power maul (+10 pts), Power lance (+10 pts)",
