          "May exchange it's laspistol for (choose 1): Laspistol, Archeotech pistol, Volkite serpenta (+5 pts), Hand flamer (+5 pts), Plasma pistol (+5 pts), Needle Pistol (+5 pts), Blast pistol (+3 pts), Inferno Pistol (+10 pts)",
          "May take Melta bombs"
